{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Long Gil Studio REST API & Content Specification (v1)",
    "summary": "Versioned REST API (/v1/), Developer Portal (/developers), CLI (@longgilstudio/cli), and machine-readable content endpoints for Long Gil Studio (longgilstudio.com).",
    "description": "Long Gil Studio is an independent game development studio from Vietnam, pioneering the AAA Indie Game (Triple-I) movement.\n\n## When to Use This API (Agent Guidance)\n- **Game & Application Catalog**: Query `/v1/projects.json` for canonical metadata and store links for **GilongWorld** (Steam PC), **Fruit Dodgeball**, **CTU - TKB - KHHT**, **Cute Hide: Query-chan**, and **Quiz 3000 English Words**.\n- **Studio & Founder Identity**: Query `/v1/studio.json` or `/llms.txt` for verified studio details and founder **Huynh Long Gil**.\n- **Sandbox Testing**: Query `/v1/sandbox.json` with `X-API-Key: lgs_sandbox_demo_key_v1`.\n\n## Official CLI Tool (`@longgilstudio/cli`)\n- **npm / npx**: `npx @longgilstudio/cli projects --format json` | `npm install -g @longgilstudio/cli`\n- **PyPI**: `pip install longgilstudio`\n- **Homebrew**: `brew install longgilstudio/tap/lgs`\n\n## Rate Limits & Self-Throttling\nAll endpoints emit standard IETF `RateLimit` headers (`RateLimit-Limit: 60`, `RateLimit-Remaining`, `RateLimit-Reset`, `RateLimit-Policy: 60;w=60`) and `X-RateLimit-*` headers. Exceeding 60 requests per 60-second window returns HTTP `429 Too Many Requests` with a `Retry-After: 60` header.\n\n## API Versioning & Deprecation Policy\n- **URL Path & Header Versioning**: Endpoints are versioned under `/v1/` and `/api/v1/` and accept the `X-API-Version` header (`v1` or `2026-10-26`).\n- **Deprecation & Sunset**: Deprecated endpoints emit `Deprecation` (RFC 9745) and `Sunset` (RFC 8594) headers at least **90 days** prior to removal.",
    "version": "1.3.0",
    "contact": {
      "name": "Long Gil Studio Developer Support",
      "url": "https://longgilstudio.com/developers",
      "email": "info@longgilstudio.com"
    },
    "license": {
      "name": "All Rights Reserved",
      "url": "https://longgilstudio.com/"
    },
    "x-logo": {
      "url": "https://longgilstudio.com/assets/img/nature/logo_GL_nb2.png"
    },
    "x-developer-portal": "https://longgilstudio.com/developers",
    "x-documentation": "https://longgilstudio.com/docs",
    "x-sandbox": {
      "url": "https://longgilstudio.com/v1/sandbox.json",
      "demo_api_key": "lgs_sandbox_demo_key_v1",
      "header": "X-API-Key"
    },
    "x-cli": {
      "name": "@longgilstudio/cli",
      "binary": "lgs",
      "npm": "npm install -g @longgilstudio/cli",
      "npx": "npx @longgilstudio/cli",
      "pypi": "pip install longgilstudio",
      "homebrew": "brew install longgilstudio/tap/lgs",
      "script_url": "https://longgilstudio.com/cli/lgs.mjs"
    },
    "x-rate-limit": {
      "limit": 60,
      "window_seconds": 60,
      "policy": "60;w=60",
      "headers": [
        "RateLimit-Limit",
        "RateLimit-Remaining",
        "RateLimit-Reset",
        "RateLimit-Policy",
        "RateLimit",
        "X-RateLimit-Limit",
        "X-RateLimit-Remaining",
        "X-RateLimit-Reset",
        "Retry-After"
      ]
    },
    "x-api-versioning": {
      "strategy": ["url-path", "header"],
      "current_version": "v1",
      "supported_versions": ["v1"],
      "path_prefix": "/v1",
      "header_name": "X-API-Version"
    },
    "x-deprecation-policy": {
      "minimum_notice_days": 90,
      "headers": ["Deprecation", "Sunset", "Link"],
      "policy_url": "https://longgilstudio.com/developers"
    }
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://longgilstudio.com",
      "description": "Production Root Server"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://longgilstudio.com/v1",
      "description": "Production REST API v1"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://longgilstudio.com/api/v1",
      "description": "Sandbox & REST API v1 Alias"
    }
  ],
